## 💰 Monetization Improvements

### Current Problem
This appears to be a single-tenant internal tool for Samara Lombok. The multi-tenant SQL setup exists but the frontend doesn't use it.

### Monetization Strategy

| Tier | Name | Price Point | Features |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Free** | Starter | $0 | 1 user, 50 candidates, basic pipeline, manual scoring |
| **Growth** | Professional | $49/user/mo | Unlimited candidates, AI scoring (100/mo), WhatsApp templates, analytics |
| **Scale** | Business | $99/user/mo | Unlimited AI, auto-scoring agents, interview scheduling, email sequences, API access |
| **Enterprise** | Enterprise | Custom | SSO, multi-tenant, audit logs, custom stages, white-label, SLA, dedicated support |

### Revenue Accelerators
1. **AI credit system** — charge per AI scoring/screening beyond tier limits (usage-based revenue)
2. **WhatsApp Business API integration** — premium feature with message delivery tracking
3. **Job board publishing** — one-click post to Glints, JobStreet, LinkedIn from within the ATS
4. **Marketplace integrations** — HRIS connectors (BambooHR, Talenta, etc.) as paid add-ons
5. **Recruitment analytics reports** — exportable PDF reports as a premium feature

---

## 🏢 Enterprise-Grade Enhancements

### Scalability

| Issue | Fix |
|---|---|
| All data fetched client-side without limits | Add server-side pagination on all views (candidates list already has it, Kanban/Dashboard do not) |
| No caching layer | Add React Query or SWR for request dedup + cache invalidation |
| Real-time refetches entire dataset | Switch to delta updates — apply the changed row to local state instead of refetching all |
| Single Supabase project = single region | Plan for multi-region Supabase deploy for enterprise customers |

### Compliance & Security

| Gap | Enhancement |
|---|---|
| **GDPR/Data privacy** | Add data retention policies, right-to-erasure flow, consent tracking |
| **API key in client** | Move ALL external API calls to Edge Functions |
| **No field-level encryption** | Encrypt PII (phone numbers, salary data) at rest using Supabase Vault |
| **No rate limiting** | Add rate limits on AI scoring to prevent abuse |
| **No data export** | Add GDPR-compliant data export (CSV download of candidate data) |
| **No SSO SCIM** | Add SCIM provisioning for enterprise AD sync |

### Integrations Needed for Enterprise

| Integration | Priority | Reason |
|---|---|---|
| **Google Calendar / Outlook** | 🔴 Critical | Interview scheduling |
| **WhatsApp Business API** | 🔴 Critical | Programmatic messaging at scale |
| **Email (Resend/SendGrid)** | 🟡 High | Automated communications |
| **HRIS (BambooHR/Talenta)** | 🟡 High | Auto-sync hired candidates to payroll |
| **Background Check APIs** | 🟡 Medium | Automate reference and background checks |
| **Job Boards (Glints/JobStreet)** | 🟡 Medium | Multi-channel sourcing |
| **Slack/Teams** | 🟢 Low | Recruiter notifications |

